<!-- feedback-received — the acknowledgement (046 US1).

     ⚠ A COURTESY, NOT A COMMITMENT. It confirms the feedback arrived; it must not promise a reply, a
     timeline, or a reward. Staff MAY reply (that is a separate message, feedback-reply), but most
     feedback is heard and acted on without one, and an implied promise here is a contract the platform
     has not agreed to.

     ⚠ TRANSACTIONAL — a direct response to the shopper's own action, so no unsubscribe footer.

     ⚠ Carries only what the shopper gave: the category they chose and their opaque reference code.
     No internal notes, no internal id, no other data (FR-038). -->

<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-include path="../generated/theme.mjml" />
    <mj-title>We got your {{effyProductName}} feedback</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Thanks for taking the time &mdash; here&rsquo;s your reference.</mj-preview>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body width="600px" background-color="#f5f5f5" css-class="e-bg-page">
    <mj-include path="../components/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding="0 32px 32px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="e-ink e-h1">
          Thanks for your feedback
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="muted" css-class="e-muted" padding="12px 0 0 0">
          We&rsquo;ve received what you sent us about &ldquo;{{category}}&rdquo; and a real person will
          read it. You don&rsquo;t need to do anything else.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="small" css-class="e-muted" padding="20px 0 0 0">
          Your reference is <strong>{{referenceCode}}</strong> &mdash; keep it in case you ever want to
          mention this feedback to us.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="small" css-class="e-muted" padding="12px 0 0 0">
          If it needs a reply, we&rsquo;ll email you back at this address.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="../components/footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
